  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「お久しぶりです転校生くん！　新学期ですねーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「いやぁ、夏休み明けっていうのは複雑な心境になっちゃいますよねーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「みんなとまた会えるのは嬉しいけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「今日からまた毎日お勉強しなくちゃいけないと思うと憂鬱〜！　みたいな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、夏休みはどうでしたかーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしは満喫しましたよーっ、生まれて初めて海外旅行とかしちゃいましたーっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしサイパンに行ってきたんですよねーっ、これお土産のマカデミアナッツチョコですーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「我慢できなくて、ちょっと食べちゃったんですけどね。美味しかったですよーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「たくさん買ってきたので、みんなに配ろうと思ってるんですーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くんにはどうも、うちの団長がお世話になったみたいですし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「お礼も兼ねて、たくさんあげちゃいますねーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「そうそう、聞きましたよ転校生くん！　団長に付きあって、海で遊んでくれたんですって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「お疲れさまですーっ、大変だったでしょう〜？　あのひと、常にハイテンションですからねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「あたしも旅行中だっていうのに、さんざんメールとか電話とかしてくるんですよーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「寂しんぼなんですよねーっ、あのひと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「海外プランにしてなかったから電話料金とかものすごくなって、お母さんに怒られちゃいましたーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「でもまぁ。団長を置き去りにしちゃって、すこし申し訳ないな〜とは思ってましたしね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「転校生くんが団長のお相手をしてくれて、すっごい助かっちゃいましたーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「まぁ、あたしも帰国してからあのひとに連れ回されて、あちこちで遊んであげたんですけどねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「ほんともう、団長ったらあたし以外に相手してくれるひといないんですかねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「困ったひとですよねーっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「とはいえ、あたしもたまには息抜きしたいですし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「ときどき転校生くんにも団長の相手してもらえるなら、ありがたいですよーっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「でもまぁ、転校生くんも忙しいですしねーっ？　あんまり頼っちゃだめですよねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「うちのチア部、他に部員がいればいいんですけどねーっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「そうしたら負担が分担できるのに〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 3,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なな",
    "text": "「みんな、団長についていけずに辞めちゃったんですよねーっ！」"
  },
  {
